[2026-07-31 11:35] fix(submissions): the Google Form/Sheet pipeline delivered nothing and ingested nothing because BOTH URL columns were NULL on every assignment — why: re-confirmed against the live database before touching anything (4 assignment rows; googleFormUrl NULL 4/4; googleSheetCsvUrl NULL 4/4). Nothing was broken. SubmitLink short-circuits to its "not yet configured" banner on a blank Form URL (src/components/submissions/SubmitLink.tsx:28) and fetchPublishedCsv returns `no_csv_url` before it opens a socket (src/lib/submissions/fetch-csv.ts:88), so a correct parser, a correct student matcher and a correct idempotent upsert all sat behind an address that did not exist, and every sweep's honest report was "4 considered, 0 ingested, 4 skipped: no_csv_url". The seeder wrote the two nulls explicitly with a TODO(decision) attached, so this was a data gap that had been correctly identified and never filled.
