s exact file (`lectures.topic_key`, `questions.points`, `questions.tests`). Every one is nullable or defaulted, so no existing query, insert or inferred type changes and no stream is broken. The four new `questions` columns are ANSWER-KEY MATERIAL and are commented as such at the block — they must be stripped from pre-submit payloads like `tests` and `options.is_correct` already are. VERIFIED, not assumed: generated SQL read line by line and contains no DROP of any kind; `npm run db:migrate` applied against the live Neon database; a follow-up information_schema query confirms 13/13 tables, 34 CHECKs, 62 indexes, and `is_enhanced` present on assignments, lectures and questions. typecheck clean, lint clean. NOT DONE, and named rather than left to be discovered: `src/db/index.ts` still passes only `./schema` to drizzle, so `db.query.liveClasses` does not exist — this matches every other sibling module and changing it is a seam change owned by shared-contracts; the denormalized counters have no maintaining trigger, because the handlers that write them belong to the backend subagent, and they are documented as display hints that never feed an authorization or completeness decision. Decisions where the spec was silent or conflicted with what exists are tabulated in DECISIONS.md; full index-to-query mapping and an ER diagram are in SCHEMA_ENHANCEMENT.md. | feature/lms-complete-enhancement

