d been filled in. STILL OPEN for the devops-testing stream, which owns the harness: nothing fails FAST on an incomplete environment. A precheck that asserts the four names before the first browser launches, and aborts the run rather than letting 500s masquerade as assertions, would have replaced both of these sessions with one line of output. | feature/perf-and-subject-sections
